        "z": "1c00011a6f22edfe",
        "name": "msg type 04,03,28 Motor Reply",
        "func": "var sequence = [4,3,28];\n/*\nThis is the Response to the request you just asked about.\n\n    Request: Read 14 registers from Device 4, starting at 1011.\n\n    Response: Here are the 28 bytes of data you asked for.\n    */\n\n\nif (msg.payload) {\n    var isMatch = true;\n\n    for (var i = 0; i < sequence.length; i++) {\n        if (msg.payload[i] !== sequence[i]) {\n            isMatch = false;\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    if (isMatch) {\n        // The message starts with the specified sequence\n        // You can perform further actions or send the message to the next node\n        return msg;\n    }\n}\n\n// The message does not start with the specified sequence\n// You can choose to discard the message or send it to a different node\nreturn null;",
